---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'; import {projects,categories} from '../../data/catalog.js';
export function getStaticPaths(){return projects.map(project=>({params:{id:String(project.id)},props:{project}}));} const {project:p}=Astro.props;
---
<Layout title={p.name}><div class="wrap page"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">首页</a> / <a href={`/flow/${p.category}/`}>{categories[p.category].name}</a> / {p.name}</div><div class="detail-head"><div><div class="kicker">GITHUB PROJECT / 公开资料</div><h1>{p.name}<span class="accent">.</span></h1><p class="repo">{p.repo}</p><p class="detail-summary">{p.summary}</p><div class="card-tags">{p.tags.map((t:string)=><span>{t}</span>)}</div></div><a class="primary-btn" href={`https://github.com/${p.repo}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往 GitHub 查看项目 ↗<span class="sr-only">（在新窗口打开）</span></a></div><div class="detail-grid"><article><section class="detail-section"><div class="kicker">OVERVIEW / 01</div><h2>它能做什么</h2><p>{p.summary}</p><p class="disclaimer">仓库原始描述：{p.description_source || "暂无"}</p><p class="disclaimer">根据 GitHub 仓库公开描述整理，未经运行实测；功能与适用范围请以原项目说明为准。</p></section><section class="detail-section"><div class="kicker">GETTING STARTED / 02</div><h2>如何开始</h2><ol><li>打开原项目，阅读项目介绍和使用条件。</li><li>核对你的设备、安装方式与所需模型。</li><li>按照原项目的说明操作，并留意相关许可。</li></ol></section>{p.flags.length > 0 && <section class="detail-section"><div class="kicker">RESPONSIBLE USE</div><h2>使用提示</h2><p>此项目涉及声音或人物形象生成，使用前应取得相关人员授权并核对适用规则。</p></section>}<section class="detail-section"><div class="kicker">LICENSE / 03</div><h2>许可与使用</h2><p>代码、模型权重及第三方组件可能采用不同许可。商用前请分别查看原项目的许可文件及说明。</p></section></article><aside><div class="info-panel"><div class="kicker">AT A GLANCE</div><h2>上手条件</h2>{[['难度',p.difficulty],['显卡',p.gpu],['代码要求',p.code],['代码许可证',p.license_spdx || '未识别'],['GitHub Stars',Number(p.stars).toLocaleString()],['数据采集',p.captured_at.slice(0,10)]].map(([label,value])=><div class="info-row"><span>{label}</span><strong>{value}</strong></div>)}<p>GitHub 识别的代码许可证不代表模型权重及依赖的许可；硬件要求暂未核实。</p></div></aside></div></div></Layout>
